- mocka: focus on MOCK3-1: The fare boundary in fareFor (src/fares.ts line 10). The comparison `rider.age > 65` excludes exactly-65-year-olds from the concession fare. The existing test suite has no case for age 65, so the investigator should add a boundary test and correct the comparison. (because I read src/fares.ts and confirmed line 10 uses strict > rather than >=, and test/fares.test.ts has no age-65 case.)
